    <briefdescription>
<para>Behler-Parrinello cutoff function. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><formula id="2">\[ f_c(r) = \begin{equation} \begin{cases} \frac{1}{2}\big[ \cos\big( \frac{\pi r}{r_c} \big)+1 \big] &amp; \text{if } r \leq r_c\\ 0 &amp; \text{otherwise}\\ \end{cases} \end{equation} \]</formula></para>
<para>Behler, J., Parrinello, M. (2007). Generalized neural-network representation of high-dimensional potential-energy surfaces. <emphasis>Physical Review Letters</emphasis>, <emphasis>98</emphasis>(14), 146401. <ulink url="https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.98.146401">https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.98.146401</ulink> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
